      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 84,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "How do I get started with Capacitor?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 86,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 86,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Visit the "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 86,
            "column": 11
          },
          "url": "https://capacitorjs.com/docs/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 86,
                "column": 12
              },
              "text": "Capacitor documentation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 86,
            "column": 67
          },
          "text": " and follow the instructions to install Capacitor in your app. If you want to start with an opinionated Capacitor app using Ionic Framework and Angular/React/Vue, follow the Get Started flow on the "
